rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T08:09:47-07:00","id":1536888,"title":"","content":"You hire some Banu Haqim to take of it Thoth or leak some details to some hunters about the kindred's location?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T12:11:50-07:00","id":1536895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1536888#post1536888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You hire some Banu Haqim to take of it Thoth or leak some details to some hunters about the kindred's location?</div> </div> </div> </div>While both are potential answers, neither are applicable for most neonates since they don't have the experience or the contacts to set that up. The Banu Haqim don't have a central website to put in an order or see what the going vitae rate for a higher up is these nights. Likewise, unless the neonates had a mortal backstory that gave them connections to hunters, they wouldn't know how to contact them.<br /> <br /> Of course the neonate could speak with their local elders and try to have them set something up, but then you run the risk of the favors owed to them being excessive, not to mention the reality that telling other vampires of your own mortal family is a security risk in and of itself before getting to the potential masquerade violation that your Grandchild could recognize kindred on sight due to your negligence and continued interaction with your mortal descendants.<br /> <br /> I have used this plot with several players over the years and they came up with some creative answers ranging from practical to disturbing.<br /> <br /> 1. Use Dominate to rewrite the targets memories to remove the vampire from their life and facilitate a practically overnight move to a new city to start a new life.<br /> <br /> 2. Lacking access to Dominate, the PCs kidnapped the target and left a bread crumb trail to a neutral third city which neither vampire has status in. The trail led to a reinforced room inside an abandoned warehouse. A trap involving gasoline and matches solved the problem.<br /> <br /> 3. The PC approached the troublesome vampire (NPC wasn't a combat build in this instance) and bluffed them. The PC claimed that the mortal was the last descendant of someone the PC had sworn vengeance against. If the vampire wanted to keep their love interest, they would have to compensate the PC for it or give up the claim. Either way it was a win/win. The NPC would either pay the PC boons/tribute and thus treasure the mortal or they would give up on it for not being worth the hassle.<br /> <br /> 4. The last time I ran this scenario, the PC was a Tremere who did a quick test to see if the target was blood bound, when they discovered that they hadn't had three doses yet, they just forcibly blood bound the target and took them back to their chantry. The other vampire had no idea what happened or why a random Tremere absconded with their most recent play toy. When I asked the Player what her next step would be, she said she was just going to keep the family member as a ghoul. Given their taste in anime and hentai, the phrase &quot;incest is win-cest&quot; was the entire explanation of the ghoul situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T15:05:26-07:00","id":1536903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1536881#post1536881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are contacted by your Great Grandchild, apparently their offspring is being seduced/enthralled by a local kindred. The parent recognized the pallor and demeanor of the kindred from their rare interactions with you. From the description, it is a high-ranking vampire of that city, what do you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't been called, but I think I'll try.<br /> <br /> I will consider that both me and the kindred in question are of relatively high level. Firstly, what I need is information, to get in touch with someone who knows what's going on in the city so I can have an idea of \u200bwho I'm dealing with, my Grandchild could be useful, but otherwise I would have to find someone else willing to talk. If I were versed in Dominate or Auspex, I would find a way to talk to my Great-Grandchild to get an idea of \u200b\u200bthis kindred's motives and make him forget about this conversation later. The next step would be based on what I found.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T15:52:05-07:00","id":1536906,"title":"","content":"@ Thoth you did say great grandchild as the descendant and that implies that young ancillae at least to older type of neonate on the higher end and bye that time he or she had probably built a network of friends and contacts that could help with the problem in getting in touch with a member of Banu Haqim or some hunters that might be aware of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T18:48:46-07:00","id":1536911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1536906#post1536906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@ Thoth you did say great grandchild as the descendant and that implies that young ancillae at least to older type of neonate on the higher end and bye that time he or she had probably built a network of friends and contacts that could help with the problem in getting in touch with a member of Banu Haqim or some hunters that might be aware of.</div> </div> </div> </div>My perspective is somewhat skewed due to knowing some IRL families whose average age of reproduction for several generations was about 14-15 years. That makes you a Great Grand Parent by the age of about 45 to 50 years old. If the vampire was embraced by about 30, then they have only been a vampire for 15 years, and that is assuming that no torpor occurred for a time skip and that the vampire was in a position to interact with such exotic clans and bloodlines.<br /> <br /> Also, I am a big fan of the &quot;running monkey&quot; concept from the &quot;Kindred of the East&quot; sub-splat line where any vampire under 100 years of undeath is more or less a child or teenager to other vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T18:50:46-07:00","id":1536913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1536903#post1536903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I haven't been called, but I think I'll try.<br /> <br /> I will consider that both me and the kindred in question are of relatively high level. Firstly, what I need is information, to get in touch with someone who knows what's going on in the city so I can have an idea of who I'm dealing with, my Grandchild could be useful, but otherwise I would have to find someone else willing to talk. If I were versed in Dominate or Auspex, I would find a way to talk to my Great-Grandchild to get an idea of \u200b\u200bthis kindred's motives and make him forget about this conversation later. The next step would be based on what I found.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Direct, to the point, and practical in application. <br /> <br /> Gold Star. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T23:05:02-07:00","id":1536931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1529461#post1529461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A ancient shows up and is not archaic at all and is secretly a well regarded Manga artist and is a sharp dresser.</div> </div> </div> </div>And curiously sparkles in sunlight instead of bursting into flames.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25666-illuminostro","name":"Illuminostro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T23:07:46-07:00","id":1536932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1529364-humor-ultimately-there-are-ten-basic-vampire-the-masquerade-plots?p=1531212#post1531212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You been tasked to find out what happened to the Lasombra Lucita and you find to your surprise is that she opened up a production company with her Banu Haqim lover Fatima and they have the biggest musical acts under their label and you want to join.</div> </div> </div> </div>More likely they created an extreme, and I mean EXTREME, channel on Porntube.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd22","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25666-illuminostro","name":"Illuminostro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"166"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-08T12:17:16-07:00","id":1537020,"title":"","content":"I'm more inclined to believe that Fatima would start a youtube channel where she shows off her skills with weapons and Lucita vents about her Daddy/Sire issues and tries to write young adult genre novels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-08T14:19:48-07:00","id":1537031,"title":"","content":"Bah, I totally imagine Fatima dumping Lucita after a few months and she ends up crawling back to Anatole before his Cainite Heresy business drives her away again.<br /> <br /> And circles and circles again.